    },
    "body": {
     "view": {
      "value": "<p><span><strong>Authors</strong>: Luke Chen, Federico Valeri, Omnia Ibrahim, Gaurav Narula</span></p><p><span>This design follows and simplifies the goals of <a href=\"https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-986%3A+Cross-Cluster+Replication\" rel=\"nofollow\">KIP-986: Cross-Cluster Replication</a> by Greg Harris, whose high level proposal provided the foundational vision for this feature.</span></p><p><span>A special thanks to PoAn Yang, Kuan-Po Tseng, and Jiunn-Yang Huang for their design and code contributions, which helped <span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\">kickstart the project</span> at its inception.</span></p><p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"></div></p><h1 id=\"KIP1279:ClusterMirroring-Status\">Status</h1><p><strong>Current state</strong>: Accepted</p><p><strong>Discussion thread</strong>: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://lists.apache.org/thread/vr3nj1smtjtl4qfn5opk7ozjc6jqjjsw\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a></p><p><strong>Voting thread</strong>: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://lists.apache.org/thread/cjo3555pzzpwtxl9tn3s3hls65y69yk6\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a></p><p><strong>JIRA</strong>: <span class=\"jira-issue conf-macro output-block\" data-jira-key=\"KAFKA-20186\" data-client-id=\"SINGLE_5aa69414-a9e9-3523-82ec-879b028fb15b_406620973_anonymous\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-name=\"jira\">\n                    <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20186\" class=\"jira-issue-key\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-wait issue-placeholder\"></span>KAFKA-20186</a>\n                            -\n            <span class=\"summary\">Getting issue details...</span>\n                                                <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-default issue-placeholder\">STATUS</span>\n                </span></p><p>Please keep the discussion on the mailing list rather than commenting on the wiki (wiki discussions get unwieldy fast).</p><h1 id=\"KIP1279:ClusterMirroring-Motivation\">Motivation</h1> [trimmed by the recording]",
      "representation": "view"
     }
    }
   },
